{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>And after this Abraham buried Sarah.</b> And from then on the field was established as a burial possession for him and for his seed. And this section is mentioned to declare the superiority of the land of Israel over all lands, for the living and for the dead, and furthermore to fulfill the word of YHWH to Abraham, that it be an inheritance for him."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:45:31.139049022Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}